	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" color="dddddd"><img src="images/icons/icon1.gif" alt="Post" border="0"> <b>Guidelines</b></font>
	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2">Membership guidelines, your possible application. <br />
Regardless of what others might tell you, we don't bite. So if you can meet the following requirements and are interested in joining AV please let an officer know.<br />
<br />
If you have any further questions, please direct them to Luvmy, Elycion, Kelletia or Uvavu. They will be happy to answer them, whatever they may be.<br />
<br />
<br />
1) Level and skill points<br />
<br />
You must be level <b>65</b> to be considered. You must also have at least <b>100</b> aa points, more = preferred<br />
<br />
2) Play time<br />
<br />
We are currently raiding 4 days a week, starting around 8:30 PM Est to 1:00 AM EST at the very latest.  If you cannot commit yourself to this sort of raiding schedule, then Ashen Vendetta is not the right guild for you. This is very important, and is not negotiable.<br />
<br />
3) Knowledge of the game<br />
<br />
We are looking for people that know what they are doing. If you can't run from Knowledge to any zone in tranquility without constantly needing a guide then Ashen Vendetta is not the right guild for you. We are looking for people who know their class well and want to raid the high end game.<br />
<br />
4) Internet and computer stability<br />
<br />
We require recruits have a broadband internet connection. We raid a lot, and have a lot of people at our raids which will be very harsh on a 56k Dial-up connection. If you are running a connection speed slower than 56k, it's likely that you will be too lagged to do anything at events. If you go Link Dead every 10 minutes you're no good to us. For the same reasons stated above, you will need a fast computer and a good video card.<br />
<br />
5) The faint of heart<br />
<br />
If you can't handle adult subject matter then you'll not fit in here.<br />
<br />
6) Items<br />
<br />
If you don't have an instant click item (such as Shrunken Goblin Skull Earing), get one. Do not expect AV to completely outfit you right away, you will be expected to have the best gear possible that can be purchased or gotten with a group (within reason).<br />
<br />
7) Raiding Experience<br />
<br />
You should have raiding experience.  We are the best and you should be very experienced at raiding.  Let us know what kind of raiding experience you have.<br />
<br />
8) Ability to follow instructions:<br />
<br />
You should be able to follow instructions.  If you can't then this guild isn't for you.  We require players who pay attention and not ones who afk and never know what's going on.<br />
<br />
9) Desire to be the best<br />
<br />
If you don't have the desire to be outfront and be the best then this guild isn't for you.  We take pride in killing shit first and putting in the hours of figuring stuff out on our own.  If you don't have the dedication or desire to be a part of a group of people who do this nightly, than this guild isn't for you.<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<br />
<b>These requirements are subject to change</b></font></p>
	
